{"sourceUrl":"https://future.suda.edu.cn/46/53/c31968a673363/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:54.154879+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://future.suda.edu.cn/46/53/c31968a673363/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>苏州大学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名工作即日起开展，现将未来科学与工程学院接收</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>级推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名具体事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>一、招生专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>计划招生专业包括：计算机科学与技术、人工智能（专业学位）、机械工程、机械工程（专业学位）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>实际招生专业和研究方向以我校正式发布的</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年招生简章和专业目录为准。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>有望获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格的</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、网上报名</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>具体请登录“研究生报考服务系统”查阅，请提前关注，以免错过报名。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>有意向申请学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年推免研究生的同学（包括本校和外校），请登录“研究生报考服务系统”（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span><span><span>），在“招生栏目”中选择“全国优秀大学生推免预报名”进行注册、预报名。考生请务必如实填写各项信息并提交。注意提交前务必认真核对，提交后不得再作更改。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>通过本系统预报名并取得了推免资格的同学，仍须在教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span><span><span>）中进行报名，否则申请无效。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、选拔与录取</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>资格审核：即日起，学院将陆续对申请人的网上报名信息进行资格初审，通过资格初审的申请人方可进入复试考核环节。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>预复试：未来科学与工程学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生的复试工作将分批次进行，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>具体复试安排将以邮件形式进行通知（请考生务必核对报名系统中的邮件及联系方式正确无误，否则后果自负）。</strong></span></span></span></span><strong><span>预复试采用意向导师面试推荐+学院小组最终面试，未获得意向导师面试推荐者无法进入学院小组面试。</span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span>请申请人及时关注学院官网通知，并按要求参加复试，学院将根据申请者复试的综合成绩择优录取。</span></span></span></span><br/></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>拟录取：通过本系统预报名并取得了推免资格的同学，待教育部开通全国推免生报名系统后，登录教育部“推免服务系统”（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span></span><span><span><span><span>）报名，学院将在教育部“推免服务系统”中先后发放复试通知和拟录取通知，申请人应在规定时间内按要求接受并确认。推免生在“推免服务系统”只能确认一个招生单位的待录取通知，一旦确认不得更改。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>五、其他事项</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学院将根据教育部、学校最新推免生政策，及时公布</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生的最新信息，请关注学院官网相关信息。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>未进行预报名的推免生届时可登录“全国推免服务系统”进行报名，学院将根据实际情况组织复试，具体安排以学院官网通知为准。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>招生咨询信息：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院联系人：杨老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>0512-65886311</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>qsyang@suda.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"3f337fc1f31d8a711b50a53b39d3efa53862789f57e38c14f8be987865e20d6e","textLength":1106,"sourceSha256":"7da3568bd424fa72fa314f3a2afb8d8adeb0da179ffc4fc849a959d7540b57b5","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2ef6ca4405c42b47baac","title":"2025年苏州大学未来科学与工程学院关于接收2026级推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:54.154879+00:00"}
